    {
      "id": 496345,
      "username": "KEVINAMAYI",
      "name": "Kevin Amayi Musungu",
      "created_at": "2026-03-24T15:45:34.953Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have managed to sort the issue by migration to version erpnext 15.102…</p>\n<p>and frappe version 15.103.0</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/b/0b1ce15b70399ab56a53e629052e1f82477f4005.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/0b1ce15b70399ab56a53e629052e1f82477f4005\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/b/0b1ce15b70399ab56a53e629052e1f82477f4005_2_690x354.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"1Aj7VMC6DbMr4RLM0JLEhAFI9Jb\" width=\"690\" height=\"354\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/b/0b1ce15b70399ab56a53e629052e1f82477f4005_2_690x354.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/b/0b1ce15b70399ab56a53e629052e1f82477f4005_2_1035x531.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/b/0b1ce15b70399ab56a53e629052e1f82477f4005_2_1380x708.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"EFEBEE\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1858×954 119 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/9/29cb23afc5b5b11250537c7a78643ee360a08e55.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/29cb23afc5b5b11250537c7a78643ee360a08e55\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/9/29cb23afc5b5b11250537c7a78643ee360a08e55_2_690x362.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"5XINCV2l5ez6cLMsdawJaeRpxt3\" width=\"690\" height=\"362\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/9/29cb23afc5b5b1125053